  *			domain will be set accordingly.
- * @regmap_irq_line	(Optional) The IRQ the device uses to signal interrupts.
- * @regmap_irq_flags	(Optional) The IRQF_ flags to use for the interrupt.
+ * @regmap_irq_line:	(Optional) The IRQ the device uses to signal interrupts.
